Not re-measured in this build: "mole up under 1 s" (play-1 measured 561–898 ms for expired moles; the mole timing code is unchanged in the play-2 diff). In these runs my clicks hit moles after ~200 ms, so recorded appearances were hit-shortened (max 312 ms).

